I'm not sure if this is a bug, since constant members of outer classes (constants, enums, classes) are accessible in inner classes:

```gdscript
extends Node

const CONST = 42

enum Enum { A, B, C }

class InnerClass:
    const X = 123

static var static_var = 456

class OtherInnerClass:
    func test():
        print(CONST) 
        print(Enum.A)
        print(InnerClass.X)
        #print(static_var) # Not accessible.

func _ready() -> void:
    var t := OtherInnerClass.new()
    t.test()
```
